flowchart TD

    A([Start Issue Process])

    A --> B{User Logged In?}

    B -->|No| C[Display 'User Not Found']
    B -->|Yes| D[Search or Select Book]

    D --> E{Book Exists?}

    E -->|No| F[Display 'E-Book Not Found']
    E -->|Yes| G{Book Available?}

    G -->|No| H[Display 'Book Currently Unavailable']

    G -->|Yes| I[Issue Book]

    I --> J[Create Borrowing Record]

    J --> K[Store User ID]
    K --> L[Store ISBN]
    L --> M[Store Issue Date]
    M --> N[Set Expiry Date = Issue Date + 7 Days]

    N --> O[Grant Read & Download Access]

    O --> P[Display Issue Date and Due Date]

    P --> Q[Display 'Book Issued Successfully']

    Q --> R{7 Days Elapsed?}

    R -->|No| R
    R -->|Yes| S[Revoke Access]

    S --> T[Mark Book as Returned]

    T --> U([End])